><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOUKAIGIKENKOUGYO CORP</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YASUE NOBUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOUKAIGIKENKOUGYO CORPORATION</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YASUE, NOBUHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YASUE NOBUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YASUE, NOBUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A sexually sensitive portion stimulating ring (10) for stimulating both male and female sexual organs during a sexual intercourse to give a sexual pleasure to both male and female, comprising a silicone-rubber inner ring (12) and  outer ring (14), wherein the both rings (12, 14) have U-shaped sections with thick-walled portions (16, 20) formed at the tip ends of the U-shapes.  The ring (10) is pressed from the opposite sides to be deformed during coitus, thereby allowing the thick-walled portions (16, 20) to contact the vulva (C) and a curved portion (18) to flatten to squeeze the penis (I) root.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un anneau de stimulation (10) d'une partie sexuellement sensible, permettant de stimuler à la fois les organes sexuels d'un homme et d'une femme pendant une relation sexuelle, afin de procurer du plaisir à la fois à l'homme et à la femme. Cet anneau comprend un anneau intérieur (12) en caoutchouc aux silicones et un anneau extérieur (14),ces deux anneaux(12, 14) possédant des sections en U pourvues de parties à parois (16, 20) épaisses, formées au niveau des extrémités desdites sections en U. L'anneau (10) est écrasé à partir des côtés opposés à déformer pendant le coït, ce qui permet aux sections de paroi épaisses (16, 20) d'entrer en contact avec la vulve (C) et une partie incurvée (18) à aplatir, comprimant ainsi la racine du pénis (I).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>